WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.631
- [Brandon] Go.

00:00:01.631 --> 00:00:04.214
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.696 --> 00:00:10.769
- [Regina] We're gonna go to
29Rooms of Instagram heaven.

00:00:10.769 --> 00:00:12.653
- Instagram is pretty much my job.

00:00:12.653 --> 00:00:14.499
- So if you haven't seen his face before,

00:00:14.499 --> 00:00:16.950
You've probably definitely
seen his Instagram.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.793
He shoots really really really cool,

00:00:19.793 --> 00:00:21.652
aesthetically-pleasing photos.

00:00:21.652 --> 00:00:23.048
My relationship with Instagram,

00:00:23.048 --> 00:00:26.003
I love it, but I don't think it loves me.

00:00:26.003 --> 00:00:28.106
- I haven't seen your profile.
We need to check it out.

00:00:28.106 --> 00:00:30.556
These are good, but I can
definitely help you out.

00:00:30.556 --> 00:00:31.556
Let's do it.

00:00:32.668 --> 00:00:34.252
- We made it to...

00:00:34.252 --> 00:00:35.872
- [Brandon] 29Rooms.

00:00:35.872 --> 00:00:38.220
- [Regina Voiceover] 29Rooms is a popup

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.022
here in Williamsburg, New York,

00:00:40.022 --> 00:00:43.557
and it's a huge funhouse of 29 different,

00:00:43.557 --> 00:00:45.990
aesthetically-pleasing
rooms that were made

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:48.054
to be put on your Instagram.

00:00:48.054 --> 00:00:49.522
- I really like the disco ball room.

00:00:49.522 --> 00:00:51.555
I wouldn't stay away from that.

00:00:51.555 --> 00:00:54.681
Do you wanna put on some glasses?

00:00:54.681 --> 00:00:56.299
You wanna make it happen?
- Do you have glasses?

00:00:56.299 --> 00:00:57.150
- [Brandon] I do have them.

00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:59.540
Ooh, we're getting some yellow vibes.

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:01.544
So fun, see they're all so different.

00:01:01.544 --> 00:01:04.721
- [Regina] It's so fricking cool.

00:01:04.721 --> 00:01:05.554
- [Brandon] Those look cool.

00:01:05.554 --> 00:01:07.551
See, the glasses, I feel
like adds a little- (snaps)

00:01:07.551 --> 00:01:08.953
- [Regina] The glasses definitely
add a little something.

00:01:08.953 --> 00:01:10.161
- Ooh, wait, I like these colors.

00:01:10.161 --> 00:01:12.274
I was like, "Wait, one more picture."

00:01:12.274 --> 00:01:13.795
- [Regina] We were kinda distracted

00:01:13.795 --> 00:01:15.533
by taking pictures the whole time,

00:01:15.533 --> 00:01:16.711
that we didn't realize that...

00:01:16.711 --> 00:01:18.273
This is a silent disco.

00:01:18.273 --> 00:01:20.773
(disco music)

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:32.893
Each room had a different, deeper meaning.

00:01:32.893 --> 00:01:34.392
- I think we uncovered it throughout.

00:01:34.392 --> 00:01:36.236
We'd be like, "Oh, that's
cool, let's go look at it."

00:01:36.236 --> 00:01:37.849
- [Regina] This is again-
- [Brandon] It's so cool.

00:01:37.849 --> 00:01:39.793
- [Regina] Brandon's aesthetic.

00:01:39.793 --> 00:01:40.756
- Dope.

00:01:40.756 --> 00:01:42.047
And then we'd be like, "Oh, wait."

00:01:42.047 --> 00:01:42.936
- [Regina] What is this?

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:45.661
That projection, right there, is me.

00:01:45.661 --> 00:01:47.885
They made me into art.

00:01:47.885 --> 00:01:49.379
The fuck? That's so cool.

00:01:49.379 --> 00:01:51.777
I loved how every room was created

00:01:51.777 --> 00:01:53.008
by a different artist.

00:01:53.008 --> 00:01:54.269
- Even, we met some of the artists.

00:01:54.269 --> 00:01:56.787
- And we got to learn a little
bit of their backstories.

00:01:56.787 --> 00:01:59.189
We found the artist.

00:01:59.189 --> 00:02:00.840
- The room is called
"The Future is Female."

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:03.058
It is in collaboration with Madame Gandhi,

00:02:03.058 --> 00:02:04.820
and she's the musical artist.

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:07.597
We pulled lyrics from her song

00:02:07.597 --> 00:02:10.522
and decorated all these
punching bags with them,

00:02:10.522 --> 00:02:13.819
and then also added sensors in the bags.

00:02:13.819 --> 00:02:18.501
So when you hit them,
they make sounds from her.

00:02:18.501 --> 00:02:19.880
(loud thump)
- [Camera Man] Oh my god-

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:22.302
(laughs)
- [Brandon] Wow.

00:02:22.302 --> 00:02:24.476
- Oh my god, I feel so powerful.

00:02:24.476 --> 00:02:26.165
- It's a really good way-
(thump)

00:02:26.165 --> 00:02:28.244
- [Regina] To let out anger?
- I'm a little scared of you.

00:02:28.244 --> 00:02:30.510
(upbeat music)

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:33.542
We just walked in this giant
tent called "The Womb."

00:02:33.542 --> 00:02:34.662
- [Regina] We are in the womb.

00:02:34.662 --> 00:02:36.560
- [Brandon Voiceover] These
headphones are like a heartbeat,

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:39.177
and I feel like an actual baby.

00:02:39.177 --> 00:02:41.005
- And that's the-
(Brandon laughs)

00:02:41.005 --> 00:02:42.502
That's the thing we come out of.

00:02:42.502 --> 00:02:44.676
One of my favorite ones
was called "Shred It,"

00:02:44.676 --> 00:02:46.551
and it's basically writing down

00:02:46.551 --> 00:02:49.319
whatever is weighing you down in life.

00:02:49.319 --> 00:02:50.276
- [Brandon Voiceover] I wrote people.

00:02:50.276 --> 00:02:52.448
I was low key kidding, and
putting it through the shredder

00:02:52.448 --> 00:02:54.770
was a cool releasing experience.

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:57.372
Kind of release whatever
you were stressing about.

00:02:57.372 --> 00:02:59.817
29Rooms is a lot more than
just a simple Instagram.

00:02:59.817 --> 00:03:02.356
There was 29 totally
different experiences for us.

00:03:02.356 --> 00:03:04.684
- Well, I did step up my Instagram game,

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:08.197
and Brandon took some
bomb-ass photos of me.

00:03:08.197 --> 00:03:09.474
We were just having fun.

00:03:09.474 --> 00:03:11.028
- [Brandon] Having a jolly good old time.

00:03:11.028 --> 00:03:12.278
- I'm so happy.

00:03:13.271 --> 00:03:14.438
I am so happy.

00:03:15.667 --> 00:03:20.659
It was a nice way to appreciate
art and experience it.

00:03:20.659 --> 00:03:21.659
Bye 29Rooms.

00:03:23.187 --> 00:03:25.364
Instagram heaven rate was
- 29 out of 29.

00:03:25.364 --> 00:03:26.197
- Would recommend.

00:03:26.197 --> 00:03:27.732
- Do you think I say like,
"Thanks for watching," with you,

00:03:27.732 --> 00:03:28.648
or just kind of end it?

00:03:28.648 --> 00:03:30.485
- Thanks for watching. Subscribe and like.

00:03:30.485 --> 00:03:31.493
No, yeah, we just end it.

00:03:31.493 --> 00:03:32.326
Bye.

00:03:33.697 --> 00:03:35.452
Ow, I don't think I can breathe.

00:03:35.452 --> 00:03:36.537
- [Brandon] This would
be a good Boomerang.

00:03:36.537 --> 00:03:38.016
Where's your phone?

00:03:38.016 --> 00:03:40.599
(upbeat music)

